(An unabridged, cinematic historical novel and multi-voice screenplay detailing the true journey of America’s most) Tj
T* (celebrated dog. From a shivering stray on a pile of canvas mail sacks in the Albany Post Office of 1888, to) Tj
T* (guardian angel of the fast mail trains, bearer of Postmaster General John Wanamaker’s custom leather harness, and) Tj
T* (global traveler across twenty-four thousand miles of ocean and rail—spanning his 129-day circumnavigation of the) Tj
T* (globe, the heartbreaking tragedy of Toledo, and his eternal enshrinement at the Smithsonian National Postal) Tj
T* (Museum.) Tj
