54. 283.5 Td
(The Historian, detailing the historic archives of Chapter 12, recorded, "In the official reports of the Railway Mail Service for) Tj
T* (this division, the superintendents noted that morale rose by nearly forty percent whenever Owney was present in the) Tj
T* (distribution car. Men who worked twenty-hour continuous shifts sorting letters by kerosene lamp found renewed endurance) Tj
T* (watching the little terrier stand guard upon the iron floor.") Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.098 g
54. 219.5 Td
(Patrick Callahan chuckled as he tossed another bundle of letters: "I've seen governors and senators demand royal treatment on) Tj
T* (the passenger coaches, but none of them ever earned their keep like this dog. Look at him keeping count of the pouches! If we) Tj
T* (miss a drop, he won't touch his supper until the count is right!") Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.098 g
54. 169. Td
(Owney cocked his head, listening intently to the changing pitch of the steel rails beneath the floorboards. To a dog attuned to) Tj
T* (the vibration of iron, every switch frog, trestle bridge, and curve sang its own distinct song.) Tj
