ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.098 g
54. 576.5 Td
(The Senior Transfer Clerk leaned against the pouch rack with a warm grin: "Every town in the union has its mayor, but) Tj
T* (Owney has a key to every city hall without ever asking for a vote. You can drop him off in Atlanta, Chicago, or Portland, and) Tj
T* (by nightfall he's dining on porterhouse steak in the division superintendent's parlor.") Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.098 g
54. 526. Td
(Angus MacDonald wiped his wire spectacles: "Aye, and he never signs a receipt or pays a dime of baggage freight. The) Tj
T* (railroad presidents gave orders to every conductor from coast to coast: 'If you see Owney, let him ride. If you put him off,) Tj
T* (don't bother reporting for work tomorrow.'") Tj
ET
